<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-146] Force IE to use &quot;edge&quot; compatible mode</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-146</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In Microsoft internal deployment, compatible level of IE will be set to &quot;5&quot; for interant sites, due to group policy set by admin.&lt;br/&gt;
Then, some JavaScript will be broken, and home page of Zeppelin cannot be rendered.&lt;br/&gt;
We need to set X-UA-Compatible tag for IE to &quot;edge&quot; to force it use the latest IE version.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12841873">ZEPPELIN-146</key>
